  "body": "Adds the **`/resolve-conflicts`** project skill and a rule for it in AGENTS.md's Autonomous Work Law.\n\n- **Contributor mode** (`/resolve-conflicts [login]`): for the author's conflicting PRs it merges main (no rebase, no force), keeps both sides of additive conflicts, takes main's snapshot PNGs and changelog files, runs the targeted gate, pushes, and comments \"ready for a re-check\". When both sides changed the same logic, or a safety rule could be dropped, it stops and reports the hunk.\n- **Maintainer mode** (`/resolve-conflicts check`): re-reads every `conflicts` PR. If it still conflicts, the author is asked once. If it's clean again, the label is dropped and it's sent to the review it needs: `merge-ready` restored, a delta review, or a full review.\n- **AGENTS.md:** the new rule, including that fork agents run contributor mode each session.\n- **`.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`:** 2 to 3 (to be announced on #681).\n\nDocs and process only.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
